invalid -sort "disk" or -limit 50: want time, cpu or ram, and 1 or more
Usage: perfwatch actions [flags]
  -json
    	print JSON instead of a table
  -limit int
    	show at most this many tool calls (default 50)
  -since value
    	list the tool calls of this much time back from now: 90m, 24h, 7d (default 24h)
  -sort string
    	order by time (newest first), cpu (highest machine CPU) or ram (most RAM growth) (default "time")

